# Workspace-local Kiro overrides (security-overrides.md contains the actual
# sensitive identifiers we BLOCK in scan; tracking it would defeat the
# purpose. Track only the .example template). Other steering files are
# personal preference — usually safe to commit if generic, but skip by
# default to avoid leaking workflow-specific paths.
